@startuml C1_Resource_Usage_Context
title C1 – Resource Usage Aggregation Scenario

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "PLMS Portal" {
  package "Angular SPA" as Spa
}
rectangle "PLMS Backend" as Backend
rectangle "OEM Platform" as Oem
rectangle "Identity Provider" as Idp

Operator --> Spa : Query usage for resource
Spa --> Backend : HTTPS (Resource Usage Request)
Backend --> Oem : Forward aggregation request
Oem --> Backend : Aggregated usage response
Backend --> Spa : JSON summary
Spa --> Operator : Show usage table & warnings
Spa --> Idp : OIDC login (pre-existing session)
Backend --> Idp : Token introspection

@enduml
